    "statementMarkdown": "Let $n \\geqslant 1$ be a positive integer. We say that an integer $k$ is a fan of $n$ if $0 \\leqslant k \\leqslant n-1$ and there exist integers $x, y, z \\in \\mathbb{Z}$ such that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nx^{2}+y^{2}+z^{2} & \\equiv 0 \\quad(\\bmod n) ; \\\\\nx y z & \\equiv k \\quad(\\bmod n) .\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLet $f(n)$ be the number of fans of $n$. Determine $f(2020)$.\n",
